{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38805","headline":"读友人诗 · 杜荀鹤","name":"读友人诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君诗通大雅，吟觉古风生。\n外却浮华景，中含教化情。\n名应高日月，道可润公卿。\n莫以孤寒耻，孤寒达更荣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38805.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38805","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}